---
import { toolsByCategory } from '../data/tools';
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <a class="logo" href="/">
          <span class="logo-mark" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M4.5 11h15M8 7l-3.5 4L8 15M16 7l3.5 4-3.5 4"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span>CunConvert</span>
        </a>
        <p>本地图片与 SVG 工具箱：格式转换、压缩、调整尺寸、裁剪、SVG 优化与矢量化。所有文件均在浏览器本地处理，不会上传到任何服务器。</p>
        <p class="footer-legal"><a href="/privacy/">隐私政策</a><span class="dot">·</span><a href="/about/">关于我们</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>SVG 工具</h4>
        {toolsByCategory('svg').map((t) => <a href={`/${t.slug}/`}>{t.name}</a>)}
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>图片转换</h4>
        {toolsByCategory('convert').map((t) => <a href={`/${t.slug}/`}>{t.name}</a>)}
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>图片处理</h4>
        {toolsByCategory('image').map((t) => <a href={`/${t.slug}/`}>{t.name}</a>)}
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>图片矢量化</h4>
        {toolsByCategory('vector').map((t) => <a href={`/${t.slug}/`}>{t.name}</a>)}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-note">CunConvert © {new Date().getFullYear()} · 所有处理均在浏览器本地完成，文件不会上传服务器</div>
  </div>
</footer>
